trait-alcohol-tolerance-name = Alcohol tolerance
trait-alcohol-tolerance-desc = Alcohol intoxicates you half as much as usual.

trait-parkour-name = Parkour
trait-parkour-desc = Practice lets you climb onto obstacles twice as fast.

trait-high-pain-threshold-name = High pain threshold
trait-high-pain-threshold-desc = You accumulate pain 25% slower, but still suffer its full consequences when it builds up.

trait-voracious-name = Voracious
trait-voracious-desc = You consume food and drinks twice as fast when feeding yourself.

trait-cold-blooded-name = Cold-blooded
trait-cold-blooded-desc = Your body produces little heat and cannot warm itself effectively. External warmth is essential.

trait-alcohol-intolerance-name = Alcohol intolerance
trait-alcohol-intolerance-desc = Intoxication also causes toxin damage to your body.

trait-one-life-name = One life
trait-one-life-desc = Death irreversibly destroys your body. Defibrillation and cloning cannot bring you back.

trait-light-step-name = Light step
trait-light-step-desc = Your footsteps are much quieter and you leave no footprints behind.

trait-anosmia-name = Anosmia
trait-anosmia-desc = You cannot smell hazardous gases such as ammonia, but remain vulnerable to them.
